@base = http://localhost:8000
@model = replace-with-result-id-from-calibration-job

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Fit on 2013–2024, evaluate only on 2025; poll the returned status_url
POST {{base}}/api/v1/harmonization/calibrate
Content-Type: application/json

{"train_start_year":2013,"train_end_year":2024,"test_year":2025}

### Native map points (lon, lat)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/detections/query
Content-Type: application/json

{"area":{"bbox":[123,44,124,45]},"start":"2025-03-01","end":"2025-03-31","daynight":"both","limit":1000}

### Monthly historical calendar; extrapolation is explicitly enabled for pre-2013 MODIS
POST {{base}}/api/v1/analytics/calendar
Content-Type: application/json

{"start":"2002-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","model_id":"{{model}}","allow_extrapolation":true}

### Seasonality and unusual months
POST {{base}}/api/v1/analytics/seasonality
Content-Type: application/json

{"start":"2025-01-01","end":"2025-12-31","model_id":"{{model}}","baseline_start_year":2013,"baseline_end_year":2024}

### Candidate co-observations; change the date/AOI to your event
POST {{base}}/api/v1/harmonization/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{"area":{"bbox":[123,44,124,45]},"start":"2025-03-01","end":"2025-03-07","modis_platform":"Aqua","viirs_platform":"SNPP","distance_km":1,"time_minutes":30,"daynight":"both"}
